{"parse": {"title": "LD-18", "pageid": 84473, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/LD-17\" title=\"LD-17\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">LD-18</span><a href=\"/wiki/LD-19\" title=\"LD-19\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">LD</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">18</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E7.81.B0.E9.BB.84.E7.9A.84.E5.AF.B9.E8.AF.9D\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"灰黄的对话\">灰黄的对话</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 灰黄的对话</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Hazy Memories</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>被<span class=\"color-value\"></span>过<span class=\"color-value\"></span>去<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>自<span class=\"color-value\"></span>己<span class=\"color-value\"></span>搀<span class=\"color-value\"></span>扶<span class=\"color-value\"></span>起<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 2310118</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">第1日。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>老师，这是什么？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>你的密友，你心底的溪流……它的根从澳大利亚伸到了你的脚心，它与你一起共舞。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>好好听听它，听听你跟它说了什么，听啊，听！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>摸它，扼住它，要让它知道你的脾性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>它不是木头，是镜子，远古的人们传给我们的镜子。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>有了它，你才能知道，你祭祀时，那些神灵究竟听到的是什么东西！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628910.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628910.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/0f/HeadIconSmall-628910.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628910.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>但它摸上去和普通的木头没有区别……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>嘿嘿……你要先跟它说话啊，用神秘术说，它只能听懂这个！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-628901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-628901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/7c/HeadIconSmall-628901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>嗯——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628912.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-628912.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628912.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628912.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-628912.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628912.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/26/HeadIconSmall-628912.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628912.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>它回应我了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">迪吉里木：</div><div>叮～～～叮～～～～铛！！！！！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628914.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628914.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/35/HeadIconSmall-628914.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628914.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"124\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>真难听……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>不是它说的难听，是你说的难听。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>您是说……只有稳定的神秘学波动，才能使它奏出好听的乐曲？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>是的……对，你要先好好跟它说话才行……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">第7日。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>呜呜……老师……我好痛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>一条人群熙攘的朝圣路，一条必经之路，你只能一步一步地踱。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>否则无法抵达那聚光之地，荣耀圣所。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>也无法为人所知。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>人群熙攘……是不是我现在多进行练习，就会快点脱离痛苦？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>来吧，来吧，用你的头紧紧地贴着胫骨，模仿那神子的姿势。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>嗯……呃——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>贴好……紧紧贴着！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>嗯————</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>越紧越好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>好————</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">第93日。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>迷茫，迷茫从你的发丝滴了下来，我感受到了你的悲伤。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>学校里的同学……他们嘲笑我……说我只会用特权来逃避学习……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>他们说我不来上课，不参加学校的运动会，也不跟他们一起去夏令营……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>每天只会在这间练习室里跳些奇怪的东西，变些戏法……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>老师，哪怕只有一天，我能跟同学们一起去做点别的吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>不行，不行，你与我约定过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>因为我要与全世界的运动员们比拼，一天都不能放松，我的一切付出都是为了那块金牌。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>每滴汗和每滴泪都将铺成我通向冠军的路。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>你记得，你都记得。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>神灵只能听见最虔诚的声音，最虔诚，最虔诚……你需得将每时每刻都奉献给它，你的心，你的血肉，你的……从这里，到这里。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>老师的手指从夏洛特的头划到了脚。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>不然，就会有人排在你的前头，神灵绝不会看你一眼……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>就像你完全不存在……你就会完全不存在……你想这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>不想。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>那……你为什么还不开始？</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div><span style=\"font-size:127%\">第569日。</span></div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>哒，哒哒，哒……不，不行。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>这个角度是可以得分的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>还不够！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>凭什么不够？你去修订比赛标准好了！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>它不够，不够！不完美，不虔诚！我看不到。你是不想，还是不能？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>呵！做这个动作就像走路一样简单。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"629801.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"629801.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/31/HeadIconSmall-629801.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-629801.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">乌鸦教练：</div><div>来，来，让神灵看看。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">夏洛特：</div><div>知道了！别再重复了！</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_lianxishi\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fe/Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_lianxishi.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\"><img alt=\"2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/600px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/900px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/ae/Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png/1200px-Cg-2_3_bg_yundonghuichang4.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>呵，我沉浸得太深了，还以为是……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>那是我本该拥有的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨揉揉眉心，表情凝重地看着场内接受众人致意的卡洛琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>什么时候开始走神的？大概是从看到卡洛琳那连脚尖的弧度都堪称完美的动作那时起……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>在这方面的要求，我们谁都不比谁低，也正因如此……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨眯了眯眼，看着场内的卡洛琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"628618.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-628618.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-628618.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"628618.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"25\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-628618.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-628618.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/8e/HeadIconSmall-628618.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-628618.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"127\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>谢谢，谢谢大家！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>我才会如此躁动。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>行礼过后，卡洛琳便退场了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>2407号，安娜，请开始。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>名为安娜的运动员上场，并做好了开始的准备。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>夏洛特，我跳得怎么样？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳从笃笃骨的身后拍了拍她的肩。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>能看出来这几年还是在进行训练的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>就只是这样吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨昂着头，睨着卡洛琳。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">笃笃骨：</div><div>比当年那个9岁的小孩好。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>哈哈～</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>不过……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>卡洛琳走到了观众席的围栏前。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">卡洛琳：</div><div>这么浓的雾，你真的能看清我的动作吗?</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>笃笃骨和卡洛琳一起向雾中望去，浓雾之中，那名叫做安娜的运动员正起舞着。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>另一边。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>纸信圈儿。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>牙仙女士，宽檐帽先生！你们来啦！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>我们来得还算及时吧？运动会的好帮手是不会错过笃笃骨小姐的表演的！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>现在这名运动员叫安娜，下一个就该笃笃骨啦，但是，我什么都看不见呀。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>雾确实有点太浓了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>希望笃笃骨上场的时候雾会散去一些。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这时，“迪吉里木”的奏乐戛然而止。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">宽檐帽：</div><div>音乐呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>浓雾中的选手停止了舞蹈，并向裁判组请示着什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>观众席开始骚乱起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅰ：</div><div>她怎么了？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅱ：</div><div>看这个手势，是申请了暂停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅲ：</div><div>暂停？她不想参加乌卢鲁运动会了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>安娜离开了赛场，观众们讨论着现在的情况。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>一段时间之后，广播声响了起来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>滋滋——请安静，请安静……现在播报来自裁判组的通报。\n</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>由于——滋——不可抗力的影响——滋滋——</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"508001.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"508001.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/5/58/HeadIconSmall-508001.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-508001.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">广播声：</div><div>安娜选手滋——申请了暂停比赛——经过裁判组的商讨——比赛暂停。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>暂停了？那笃笃骨怎么办？我们看不到笃笃骨了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>听到了广播的消息，一些心急的观众起身准备离场，但仍有观众坚持留在原地。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"509401.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"509401.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/20/HeadIconSmall-509401.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-509401.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅰ：</div><div>怎么能暂停？我们好不容易才办起来的！她怎么能退缩？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"505701.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"505701.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/69/HeadIconSmall-505701.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-505701.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅲ：</div><div>我还听说，叩门飞匙赛那边有运动员撞到墙了。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"510820.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"510820.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9d/HeadIconSmall-510820.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-510820.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">观众Ⅱ：</div><div>走吗？后面没有了吗？我还没有看够。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">纸信圈儿：</div><div>牙仙女士……怎么办？下一名就是笃笃骨了……这样的话太可惜了……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">牙仙：</div><div>……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>牙仙看着暗黄的浓雾，叹了口气。</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "LD-18"}}